      '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M4 10 12 4l8 6"/><path d="M6 10v11"/><path d="M18 10v11"/><path d="M10 21v-6h4v6"/><path d="M9 12h.01"/><path d="M15 12h.01"/></svg>',
